WEBVTT

00:00:20.221 --> 00:00:22.056
I'm sorry, Dad.

00:00:23.892 --> 00:00:25.351
[sighs]

00:00:26.686 --> 00:00:27.854
[sniffling]

00:00:34.903 --> 00:00:38.656
I'm not the chief
that you wanted me to be.

00:00:38.865 --> 00:00:42.660
And I'm not
the peacekeeper I thought I was.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:47.081
I don't know…

00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:49.375
[sighs]

00:01:00.178 --> 00:01:02.597
You came early into this world.

00:01:02.931 --> 00:01:05.516
You were such a wee thing.

00:01:05.725 --> 00:01:08.728
So frail, so fragile.

00:01:08.853 --> 00:01:11.731
I feared you wouldn't make it.

00:01:13.483 --> 00:01:15.276
But your father…

00:01:15.985 --> 00:01:17.570
He never doubted.

00:01:19.113 --> 00:01:20.323
He always said

00:01:20.406 --> 00:01:23.076
you would become
the strongest of them all.

00:01:23.743 --> 00:01:25.286
And he was right.

00:01:27.121 --> 00:01:31.793
You have the heart of a chief
and the soul of a dragon.

00:01:31.876 --> 00:01:35.838
Only you can bring
our worlds together.

00:01:36.839 --> 00:01:40.593
That is who you are, son.

00:01:54.399 --> 00:01:55.692
I, uh…

00:01:56.776 --> 00:02:00.363
I was so afraid of becoming my dad.

00:02:01.906 --> 00:02:04.867
Mostly because I thought I never could.

00:02:05.034 --> 00:02:08.705
How do you become someone that great?

00:02:08.913 --> 00:02:12.792
That brave? That selfless?

00:02:16.254 --> 00:02:19.007
I guess you can only try.

00:02:26.347 --> 00:02:29.308
A chief protects his own.

00:02:32.645 --> 00:02:34.355
We are going back.

00:02:35.481 --> 00:02:37.442
Uh, with what?

00:02:37.608 --> 00:02:39.360
He took all the dragons.

00:02:39.444 --> 00:02:41.279
Not all of them.

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:48.244
[all screaming]

00:02:52.623 --> 00:02:54.625
[Fishlegs] I don't want to die!

00:02:54.792 --> 00:02:56.085
We can't fly these things!

00:02:56.252 --> 00:02:57.545
[Fishlegs] Yeah, no kidding!

00:02:57.754 --> 00:02:59.255
[grunts] Whoa!

00:02:59.338 --> 00:03:00.923
[yelling]

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:03.134
But won't that Bewilderbeast just

00:03:03.217 --> 00:03:05.178
take control of these guys, too?

00:03:05.261 --> 00:03:08.181
They're babies.
They don't listen to anyone.

00:03:08.347 --> 00:03:10.349
Yeah! Just like us!

00:03:10.516 --> 00:03:13.644
This is very dangerous!

00:03:13.728 --> 00:03:15.021
[Gobber screams]

00:03:17.482 --> 00:03:21.444
Some might suggest
this is poorly conceived.

00:03:21.527 --> 00:03:23.488
It's a good thing that I never listen.

00:03:25.281 --> 00:03:28.868
So what is your… plan?

00:03:28.993 --> 00:03:32.205
Get Toothless back and kick Drago's…

00:03:32.413 --> 00:03:33.498
Heads up!

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.583
And that thing.

00:03:35.666 --> 00:03:37.126
Whoa… Ow!

00:03:41.506 --> 00:03:42.507
[rumbling]

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:44.342
[roaring]

00:03:45.843 --> 00:03:47.178
[snoring]

00:03:50.264 --> 00:03:51.474
[squawking]

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:59.107
[gasps]

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:00.858
[exclaiming happily] That's a good boy.

00:04:00.942 --> 00:04:02.068
[cooing]

00:04:07.156 --> 00:04:08.783
[stammers] Watch the furniture!

00:04:09.951 --> 00:04:11.619
Where are you going? [gasps]

00:04:13.287 --> 00:04:14.747
[people speaking indistinctly]

00:04:22.964 --> 00:04:25.466
[roaring]

00:04:26.384 --> 00:04:27.885
[all gasp]

00:04:28.136 --> 00:04:31.139
Your chief is dead.

00:04:31.764 --> 00:04:33.015
Stoick?

00:04:33.850 --> 00:04:36.477
No one can protect you now.

00:04:36.561 --> 00:04:38.229
[roaring]

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:50.491
[gasps]

00:04:51.659 --> 00:04:52.743
[Hiccup] No.

00:04:53.327 --> 00:04:55.246
He took all the dragons!

00:04:57.248 --> 00:05:00.960
Distract the alpha.
Try to keep his focus off Toothless.

00:05:01.043 --> 00:05:02.503
Uh… How?

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:04.380
Have you forgotten who you're riding with?

00:05:04.463 --> 00:05:07.842
There isn't a dragon alive
that I can't wrangle!

00:05:07.925 --> 00:05:09.218
Except for this one!

00:05:09.302 --> 00:05:10.469
Amateur.

00:05:11.929 --> 00:05:13.514
Hey, look. It's Hiccup!

00:05:13.764 --> 00:05:15.433
[all cheering]

00:05:20.229 --> 00:05:21.230
What?

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:32.783
[bleating]

00:05:35.494 --> 00:05:37.038
[Ruffnut grunts] Keep them coming!

00:05:37.288 --> 00:05:38.915
Black sheep, baby!

00:05:38.998 --> 00:05:40.583
[roaring]

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.759
[bleating]

00:05:50.051 --> 00:05:51.093
[Snotlout] Ten points!

00:05:52.595 --> 00:05:53.596
[all laughing]

00:05:53.679 --> 00:05:54.680
Uh-oh.

00:05:59.101 --> 00:06:00.102
[giggling]

00:06:00.186 --> 00:06:01.187
[growls]

00:06:01.437 --> 00:06:02.438
[gasps]

00:06:05.483 --> 00:06:06.901
[Fishlegs] I'm okay!

00:06:13.157 --> 00:06:14.533
[exhales]

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:17.995
You certainly are
hard to get rid of, I'll say that.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.497
Toothless?

00:06:20.831 --> 00:06:22.124
Hey,

00:06:22.333 --> 00:06:24.001
it's me, bud.

00:06:24.585 --> 00:06:25.586
It's me.

00:06:25.836 --> 00:06:27.755
It's me. I'm right here, bud.

00:06:28.506 --> 00:06:29.966
Come back to me.

00:06:30.049 --> 00:06:31.676
[Drago laughs]

00:06:31.842 --> 00:06:34.470
He's not yours anymore.

00:06:34.679 --> 00:06:36.472
He belongs to the alpha.

00:06:36.681 --> 00:06:40.184
But, please, great dragon master,

00:06:40.351 --> 00:06:42.645
try to take him.

00:06:42.853 --> 00:06:46.274
He will not miss a second time.

00:06:46.649 --> 00:06:48.442
It wasn't your fault, bud.

00:06:49.902 --> 00:06:52.280
They made you do it.

